WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
You also need to respect the living habits of an old man like me.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,000
Try it out for a month

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,240
If we don't get along well, you still have to leave. Are you willing? I do, Xiao Ke

4
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,640
Wash your hands before eating

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,000
After eating, slowly move grandma

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,080
I already give you a small rent

7
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,200
Why do I have the nerve to eat with you again?

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,480
People are getting old

9
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:19,720
Don’t you just look forward to having someone to go home with and have dinner with you?

10
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,140
You should repay me

11
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:27,450
Then I will wash the dishes later, grandma

12
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:28,690
This fish is delicious

13
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:29,930
how did you do it

14
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:31,810
This is my exclusive secret recipe

15
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:32,970
If you want to learn

16
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:34,690
I can teach you later

17
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,940
Grandma Ling has no defense against me

18
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,380
But I have an ulterior motive
